    user_response: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#F9FAFB] font-sans flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-[#1F2937]\\\">\\n  <!-- Navigation Bar -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"w-full h-20 px-12 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-200 bg-white\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-[#0F6E56] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl\\\">A</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#0F6E56]\\\">AccoNet <span class=\\\"font-normal text-gray-400\\\">|</span> \330\243\331\203\331\210\331\206\331\212\330\252</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-8\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold hover:text-[#0F6E56]\\\">Experts</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold hover:text-[#0F6E56]\\\">AI Tools</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold hover:text-[#0F6E56]\\\">Dashboard</a>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center bg-gray-100 rounded-full p-1\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold rounded-full bg-[#0F6E56] text-white\\\">EN</button>\\n        <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-gray-500\\\">FR</button>\\n        <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-gray-500\\\">AR</button>\\n      </div>\\n      <button class=\\\"bg-[#0F6E56] text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-bold\\\">Get Started</button>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex px-12 py-10 gap-12\\\">\\n    <!-- Hero Section (Editorial Style) -->\\n    <div class=\\\"w-7/12 flex flex-col justify-center\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#0F6E56] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-6\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-8 h-[1px] bg-[#0F6E56]\\\"></span>\\n        The Future of Algerian Accounting\\n      </div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-7xl font-extrabold leading-[0.9] text-[#1F2937] mb-6\\\">\\n        Empowering <span class=\\\"text-[#0F6E56]\\\">Business</span> in Algeria.\\n      </h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-xl text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-lg\\\">\\n        Connect with certified chartered accountants, auditors, and tax consultants across 58 wilayas. Trust, compliance, and growth\342\200\224all in one place.\\n      </p>\\n\\n      <!-- Quick Search Bar -->\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white p-2 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-2 max-w-xl\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 px-4 border-r border-gray-100\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"block text-[10px] uppercase text-gray-400 font-bold mb-1\\\">Specialty</label>\\n          <select class=\\\"w-full bg-transparent text-sm font-semibold outline-none\\\">\\n            <option>Chartered Accountant</option>\\n            <option>Tax Consultant</option>\\n          </select>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 px-4\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"block text-[10px] uppercase text-gray-400 font-bold mb-1\\\">Wilaya</label>\\n          <select class=\\\"w-full bg-transparent text-sm font-semibold outline-none\\\">\\n            <option>Alger (16)</option>\\n            <option>Oran (31)</option>\\n          </select>\\n        </div>\\n        <button class=\\\"bg-[#F59E0B] text-white p-4 rounded-xl\\\">\\n          <svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"><circle cx=\\\"11\\\" cy=\\\"11\\\" r=\\\"8\\\"/><path d=\\\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\\\"/></svg>\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Stats -->\\n      <div class=\\\"flex gap-12 mt-12 border-t border-gray-100 pt-8\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold\\\">1,200+</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase\\\">Verified Pros</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold\\\">48</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase\\\">Wilayas</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold\\\">3.5k</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase\\\">Businesses</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Professional Showcase Card -->\\n    <div class=\\\"w-5/12 flex flex-col justify-center items-end relative\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-full max-w-[340px] bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-8 shadow-2xl border border-gray-50 relative z-10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-20 h-20 bg-teal-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#0F6E56] text-3xl font-bold\\\">\\n            AM\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold uppercase animate-pulse\\\">\\n            \342\227\217 Available\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold\\\">Amine Meziane</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[#0F6E56] font-medium mb-4\\\">Chartered Accountant</p>\\n        \\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 mb-6\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[#F59E0B]\\\">\342\230\205\342\230\205\342\230\205\342\230\205\342\230\205</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-gray-400\\\">(128 Reviews)</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-3 mb-8\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-sm\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-gray-400\\\">Location</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"font-bold\\\">Alger, DZ</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-sm\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-gray-400\\\">Experience</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"font-bold\\\">12 Years</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-sm\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-gray-400\\\">Rate</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"font-bold text-[#0F6E56]\\\">4,500 DZD/hr</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <button class=\\\"w-full bg-[#1F2937] text-white py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-black transition-colors\\\">\\n          View Profile\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Decorative Elements -->\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute top-1/2 right-1/2 translate-x-1/3 -translate-y-1/2 w-64 h-64 bg-[#0F6E56] rounded-full blur-[100px] opacity-10\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute -bottom-4 -left-4 w-40 h-40 bg-[#F59E0B] rounded-full blur-[80px] opacity-10\\\"></div>\\n      \\n      <!-- AI Tool Floating Card -->\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute top-20 -left-10 bg-white shadow-xl p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-3 z-20 transform -rotate-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-orange-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-orange-500\\\">\\n           <svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"><path d=\\\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\\\"/><polyline points=\\\"17 8 12 3 7 8\\\"/><line x1=\\\"12\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"12\\\" y2=\\\"15\\\"/></svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-gray-400\\\">AI OCR Parser</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-xs font-bold\\\">Statement Processed</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"w-full h-16 px-12 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-gray-400 font-medium\\\">\\n    <div>\302\251 2024 ACCONET ALGERIA. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-6 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#0F6E56]\\\">Privacy Policy</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#0F6E56]\\\">Terms of Service</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"