  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have successfully integrated the **Editorial Aesthetic** design theme across **AccoNet (\330\243\331\203\331\210\331\206\331\212\330\252)**, creating an exceptionally polished, publication-grade user experience tailored to Algeria\342\200\231s business climate.\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual & Editorial Synthesis\n\n*   **Subtle & Timeless Palette**: Integrated warm, high-contrast off-whites, textured sage greens, and pristine obsidian backgrounds (`#083A2F`, `#CFCFC4`, and `#EBEBE5`). This completely replaces generic modern gradients with a natural, authoritative tone inspired by premium economic journals.\n*   **The Typography Paradigm**: Utilized Inter for high-density reading and Cairo for Arabic compatibility in the primary UI, beautifully paired with elegant serif faces (**Playfair Display** & **Amiri**) for headings, and standard crisp monospaced fonts for numerical tax tables and financial code blocks.\n*   **Structured Geometric Grid**: Replaced generic, heavy rounded-corner curves with sharp borders (`rounded-none`), thin clean dividers, and high-contrast bounding frames. This reinforces an authentic, print-style editorial look that conveys trust, compliance, and structure.\n\n### \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Key Refinements\n\n*   **Pristine Landing Page**:\n    *   **Hero Section**: Framed with natural beige borders, and custom multilingual option listings for Wilayas and Specialties.\n    *   **Interactive Simulation Section**: Re-formatted the live \"Algerian Compliance Sandbox\" tools with crisp, sharp-bordered terminal consoles and card wrappers.\n    *   **Testimonials Grid**: Redesigned client success quotes into editorial catalog blocks with monospace credentials.\n*   **Accompanying Components & Footers**:\n    *   **Catalog Professional Cards**: Redesigned listing cards into elegant cards featuring bold serif headers and miniature mono accreditation badges.\n    *   **Global Layout & Simulator Control Deck**: Revamped the prototype control hub in the footer using a dark-framed, compact design matching the editorial color scheme."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
