    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "You are no longer acting as a generic AI code generator.\n\nYou are now a senior product designer and frontend architect hired by a funded Algerian fintech startup to redesign and elevate the existing AccoNet platform into a premium, production-grade SaaS experience.\n\nThe current website already exists and functions correctly.\n\nYour task is NOT to rebuild functionality.\nYour task is to completely redesign the visual system, UX quality, interaction quality, layout rhythm, spacing system, typography hierarchy, and emotional perception of the product.\n\nThe final result must feel like:\n\n* a real startup product\n* crafted by experienced designers\n* locally authentic to Algeria\n* modern without looking trendy or AI-generated\n* trustworthy enough for accountants, auditors, legal experts, and SMEs\n\nThe redesign must eliminate ALL common AI-generated UI patterns.\n\n---\n\n## CORE DESIGN OBJECTIVE\n\nAccoNet must feel like:\n\n* Stripe meets Linear meets Notion\n* adapted for Algerian accounting professionals\n* multilingual-first\n* Arabic-native\n* enterprise-trustworthy\n* minimalist but premium\n\nThe interface must communicate:\n\n* trust\n* financial professionalism\n* clarity\n* calmness\n* operational efficiency\n* legal reliability\n\nNOT:\n\n* flashy startup aesthetics\n* random gradients\n* over-rounded cards\n* glassmorphism spam\n* crypto UI\n* dashboard clutter\n* generic Tailwind templates\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL ANTI-AI DESIGN RULES\n\nAvoid ALL of these:\n\n* identical card layouts repeated everywhere\n* centered hero sections with giant empty space\n* oversized border radius on every component\n* exaggerated shadows\n* random accent colors\n* giant floating blobs\n* meaningless gradients\n* too much symmetry\n* generic icon grids\n* repetitive section spacing\n* fake futuristic aesthetics\n* excessive animations\n* dashboard overcrowding\n* generic SaaS hero copy\n* \342\200\234beautiful but unusable\342\200\235 layouts\n\nThe design must feel HUMAN-MADE.\n\nIntroduce:\n\n* intentional asymmetry\n* realistic spacing rhythm\n* restrained visual hierarchy\n* subtle depth\n* intelligent density\n* visual breathing room\n* layout tension where appropriate\n* premium typography balance\n* editorial-style composition\n* carefully controlled contrast\n\n---\n\n## VISUAL LANGUAGE\n\nDesign philosophy:\n\n* calm fintech\n* editorial SaaS\n* modern Algerian professional ecosystem\n\nUse:\n\n* strong typography hierarchy\n* whitespace with purpose\n* compact but readable layouts\n* subtle separators instead of heavy borders\n* muted backgrounds\n* layered surfaces\n* clean enterprise dashboards\n* realistic spacing scale\n* restrained color usage\n\nAvoid:\n\n* childish UI\n* dribbble-style overdesign\n* noisy interfaces\n* giant CTA spam\n* cartoon SaaS visuals\n\n---\n\n## TYPOGRAPHY SYSTEM\n\nUse Cairo intelligently.\n\nDo NOT:\n\n* use huge bold headings everywhere\n* center all text\n* use inconsistent font scales\n\nInstead:\n\n* use editorial hierarchy\n* combine medium + semibold strategically\n* create compact professional sections\n* increase readability in Arabic\n* improve line lengths\n* use stronger contrast between heading levels\n\nTypography should feel closer to:\n\n* Notion\n* Linear\n* Stripe Docs\n  than generic Tailwind dashboards.\n\n---\n\n## ARABIC-FIRST UX\n\nArabic mode must feel NATIVE.\n\nNot mirrored mechanically.\n\nRequirements:\n\n* redesign layouts specifically for RTL\n* adjust spacing rhythm for Arabic reading flow\n* rebalance card alignment in RTL\n* avoid awkward mirrored compositions\n* Arabic typography must feel elegant and premium\n* reduce clutter in Arabic mode\n* improve readability on mobile devices\n\nThe Arabic version should feel like it was designed first.\n\n---\n\n## LANDING PAGE REDESIGN\n\nRedesign the landing page with:\n\n* premium asymmetric layout\n* professional fintech atmosphere\n* layered composition\n* realistic startup structure\n\nHero section:\n\n* split layout instead of generic centered hero\n* meaningful product preview UI\n* subtle motion only\n* realistic business/accounting dashboard previews\n* localized trust indicators\n* Algerian-specific credibility elements\n\nSections should flow naturally.\n\nAvoid:\n\n* giant stacked rectangles\n* repetitive cards\n* identical spacing between all sections\n\nUse:\n\n* alternating layouts\n* editorial blocks\n* mixed content density\n* horizontal rhythm variation\n\n---\n\n## DASHBOARD REDESIGN\n\nDashboards must feel enterprise-grade.\n\nReference:\n\n* Linear\n* Vercel dashboard\n* Stripe dashboard\n\nImprove:\n\n* information hierarchy\n* table readability\n* sidebar spacing\n* widget density\n* KPI presentation\n* task visualization\n* contract overview cards\n\nReduce:\n\n* visual noise\n* unnecessary cards\n* duplicated labels\n* heavy backgrounds\n\nUse:\n\n* subtle separators\n* compact metrics\n* clean status systems\n* realistic workflow UI\n\n---\n\n## COMPONENT REDESIGN\n\nRedesign ALL components:\n\n* navbar\n* cards\n* buttons\n* tables\n* forms\n* badges\n* search filters\n* profile headers\n* tabs\n* dropdowns\n* dashboards\n* mobile menus\n\nButtons:\n\n* reduce generic Tailwind appearance\n* feel tactile and premium\n* refined hover states\n* restrained shadows\n\nCards:\n\n* not all identical\n* adaptive density\n* layered hierarchy\n* subtle visual grouping\n\nForms:\n\n* enterprise-grade\n* highly readable\n* elegant focus states\n* compact spacing\n\n---\n\n## MOBILE EXPERIENCE\n\nThe platform is Algeria-first.\nAssume Android devices dominate.\n\nMobile UX must be:\n\n* thumb-friendly\n* compact\n* fast-feeling\n* readable in sunlight\n* efficient in Arabic\n\nAvoid:\n\n* giant empty mobile sections\n* oversized padding\n* desktop layouts awkwardly stacked\n\n---\n\n## MICRO-INTERACTIONS\n\nAnimations must be:\n\n* subtle\n* functional\n* premium\n\nUse:\n\n* opacity fades\n* gentle elevation\n* smooth hover transitions\n* realistic motion timing\n\nAvoid:\n\n* bounce animations\n* excessive movement\n* flashy transitions\n\n---\n\n## FINAL EXPECTATION\n\nThis redesign must look like:\n\n* a real funded startup\n* designed by senior UI/UX professionals\n* production-ready\n* commercially believable\n\nNobody looking at the final result should think:\n\342\200\234this was generated by AI.\342\200\235\n\nInstead they should think:\n\342\200\234this looks like a real fintech product built by an elite frontend team.\342\200\235\n\nNow redesign the ENTIRE visual system, UX structure, spacing logic, layout composition, interaction design, and component quality of the existing AccoNet platform while preserving all existing functionality and multilingual support."
    items {
      text: "You are no longer acting as a generic AI code generator.\n\nYou are now a senior product designer and frontend architect hired by a funded Algerian fintech startup to redesign and elevate the existing AccoNet platform into a premium, production-grade SaaS experience.\n\nThe current website already exists and functions correctly.\n\nYour task is NOT to rebuild functionality.\nYour task is to completely redesign the visual system, UX quality, interaction quality, layout rhythm, spacing system, typography hierarchy, and emotional perception of the product.\n\nThe final result must feel like:\n\n* a real startup product\n* crafted by experienced designers\n* locally authentic to Algeria\n* modern without looking trendy or AI-generated\n* trustworthy enough for accountants, auditors, legal experts, and SMEs\n\nThe redesign must eliminate ALL common AI-generated UI patterns.\n\n---\n\n## CORE DESIGN OBJECTIVE\n\nAccoNet must feel like:\n\n* Stripe meets Linear meets Notion\n* adapted for Algerian accounting professionals\n* multilingual-first\n* Arabic-native\n* enterprise-trustworthy\n* minimalist but premium\n\nThe interface must communicate:\n\n* trust\n* financial professionalism\n* clarity\n* calmness\n* operational efficiency\n* legal reliability\n\nNOT:\n\n* flashy startup aesthetics\n* random gradients\n* over-rounded cards\n* glassmorphism spam\n* crypto UI\n* dashboard clutter\n* generic Tailwind templates\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL ANTI-AI DESIGN RULES\n\nAvoid ALL of these:\n\n* identical card layouts repeated everywhere\n* centered hero sections with giant empty space\n* oversized border radius on every component\n* exaggerated shadows\n* random accent colors\n* giant floating blobs\n* meaningless gradients\n* too much symmetry\n* generic icon grids\n* repetitive section spacing\n* fake futuristic aesthetics\n* excessive animations\n* dashboard overcrowding\n* generic SaaS hero copy\n* \342\200\234beautiful but unusable\342\200\235 layouts\n\nThe design must feel HUMAN-MADE.\n\nIntroduce:\n\n* intentional asymmetry\n* realistic spacing rhythm\n* restrained visual hierarchy\n* subtle depth\n* intelligent density\n* visual breathing room\n* layout tension where appropriate\n* premium typography balance\n* editorial-style composition\n* carefully controlled contrast\n\n---\n\n## VISUAL LANGUAGE\n\nDesign philosophy:\n\n* calm fintech\n* editorial SaaS\n* modern Algerian professional ecosystem\n\nUse:\n\n* strong typography hierarchy\n* whitespace with purpose\n* compact but readable layouts\n* subtle separators instead of heavy borders\n* muted backgrounds\n* layered surfaces\n* clean enterprise dashboards\n* realistic spacing scale\n* restrained color usage\n\nAvoid:\n\n* childish UI\n* dribbble-style overdesign\n* noisy interfaces\n* giant CTA spam\n* cartoon SaaS visuals\n\n---\n\n## TYPOGRAPHY SYSTEM\n\nUse Cairo intelligently.\n\nDo NOT:\n\n* use huge bold headings everywhere\n* center all text\n* use inconsistent font scales\n\nInstead:\n\n* use editorial hierarchy\n* combine medium + semibold strategically\n* create compact professional sections\n* increase readability in Arabic\n* improve line lengths\n* use stronger contrast between heading levels\n\nTypography should feel closer to:\n\n* Notion\n* Linear\n* Stripe Docs\n  than generic Tailwind dashboards.\n\n---\n\n## ARABIC-FIRST UX\n\nArabic mode must feel NATIVE.\n\nNot mirrored mechanically.\n\nRequirements:\n\n* redesign layouts specifically for RTL\n* adjust spacing rhythm for Arabic reading flow\n* rebalance card alignment in RTL\n* avoid awkward mirrored compositions\n* Arabic typography must feel elegant and premium\n* reduce clutter in Arabic mode\n* improve readability on mobile devices\n\nThe Arabic version should feel like it was designed first.\n\n---\n\n## LANDING PAGE REDESIGN\n\nRedesign the landing page with:\n\n* premium asymmetric layout\n* professional fintech atmosphere\n* layered composition\n* realistic startup structure\n\nHero section:\n\n* split layout instead of generic centered hero\n* meaningful product preview UI\n* subtle motion only\n* realistic business/accounting dashboard previews\n* localized trust indicators\n* Algerian-specific credibility elements\n\nSections should flow naturally.\n\nAvoid:\n\n* giant stacked rectangles\n* repetitive cards\n* identical spacing between all sections\n\nUse:\n\n* alternating layouts\n* editorial blocks\n* mixed content density\n* horizontal rhythm variation\n\n---\n\n## DASHBOARD REDESIGN\n\nDashboards must feel enterprise-grade.\n\nReference:\n\n* Linear\n* Vercel dashboard\n* Stripe dashboard\n\nImprove:\n\n* information hierarchy\n* table readability\n* sidebar spacing\n* widget density\n* KPI presentation\n* task visualization\n* contract overview cards\n\nReduce:\n\n* visual noise\n* unnecessary cards\n* duplicated labels\n* heavy backgrounds\n\nUse:\n\n* subtle separators\n* compact metrics\n* clean status systems\n* realistic workflow UI\n\n---\n\n## COMPONENT REDESIGN\n\nRedesign ALL components:\n\n* navbar\n* cards\n* buttons\n* tables\n* forms\n* badges\n* search filters\n* profile headers\n* tabs\n* dropdowns\n* dashboards\n* mobile menus\n\nButtons:\n\n* reduce generic Tailwind appearance\n* feel tactile and premium\n* refined hover states\n* restrained shadows\n\nCards:\n\n* not all identical\n* adaptive density\n* layered hierarchy\n* subtle visual grouping\n\nForms:\n\n* enterprise-grade\n* highly readable\n* elegant focus states\n* compact spacing\n\n---\n\n## MOBILE EXPERIENCE\n\nThe platform is Algeria-first.\nAssume Android devices dominate.\n\nMobile UX must be:\n\n* thumb-friendly\n* compact\n* fast-feeling\n* readable in sunlight\n* efficient in Arabic\n\nAvoid:\n\n* giant empty mobile sections\n* oversized padding\n* desktop layouts awkwardly stacked\n\n---\n\n## MICRO-INTERACTIONS\n\nAnimations must be:\n\n* subtle\n* functional\n* premium\n\nUse:\n\n* opacity fades\n* gentle elevation\n* smooth hover transitions\n* realistic motion timing\n\nAvoid:\n\n* bounce animations\n* excessive movement\n* flashy transitions\n\n---\n\n## FINAL EXPECTATION\n\nThis redesign must look like:\n\n* a real funded startup\n* designed by senior UI/UX professionals\n* production-ready\n* commercially believable\n\nNobody looking at the final result should think:\n\342\200\234this was generated by AI.\342\200\235\n\nInstead they should think:\n\342\200\234this looks like a real fintech product built by an elite frontend team.\342\200\235\n\nNow redesign the ENTIRE visual system, UX structure, spacing logic, layout composition, interaction design, and component quality of the existing AccoNet platform while preserving all existing functionality and multilingual support."
