  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Confirming Success and Reviewing**\n\nThe build has succeeded, and I\'m very pleased with the flawless execution. I\'ve re-implemented `/src/pages/Register.tsx`, which now handles the dual registration flow for Professionals and Mhni, complete with a new 4-step wizard. I\'m focusing on ensuring its robustness and intuitive user experience.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the multi-step registration wizard, premium editorial landing page, and professional card structural variants for **AccoNet (\330\243\331\203\331\210\331\206\331\212\330\252)**, tailored to the Algerian regulatory framework.\n\nHere is a summary of the achievements:\n\n### 1. Advanced Dual Registration Wizard (`Register.tsx`)\n* **Professional Pathway (*Mhni / Professionnel*) \342\200\224 4-Step Wizard:**\n  * **Step 1 (*Account Info*):** Captures essential user details. Includes a custom Algerian phone operator select with country flag (`+213` prefix supporting `06` Mobilis, `07` Djezzy, and `05` Ooredoo) and a robust Wilaya selector listing all 48 wilayas ordered by code.\n  * **Step 2 (*Professional Identity*):** Dynamic inputs tailored for Expert-Comptables, Commissaire aux Comptes, and Comptables Agr\303\251\303\251s. Includes accreditation and registry numbers, a custom years-of-experience slider (1 to 40 years), and worker languages selection.\n  * **Step 3 (*Document Upload*):** Integrates the custom `DocumentUpload` drag-and-drop component in a 4-grid interface (Carte Professionnelle, Pi\303\250ce d\'Identit\303\251, Attestation d\'Inscription, and optional D\303\251cision d\'Agr\303\251ment) with real-time feedback (e.g., *\"3/4 documents charg\303\251s\"*).\n  * **Step 4 (*Review & Submit*):** Consolidates all input fields into an review card before checking for legal probity as per **Article 222 du Code P\303\251nal alg\303\251rien** regarding forgery prevention. Submitting generates a unique reference ID following the requested pattern (e.g., `ACC-PRO-2026-64583`).\n\n* **Business Client Pathway (*Mou\'assassa / Entreprise*) \342\200\224 3-Step Wizard:**\n  * **Step 1 (*Account Info*):** Establishes company contacts, email, phone with operator filters, and legal entity types.\n  * **Step 2 (*Business Identity*):** Asks for French/Arabic company names, Registre de Commerce (RC) matching CNRC patterns (`XX/XXXXXX/XX`), 15-digit NIF, and AI numbers. Supports selective fiscal regimes (R\303\251el/IBS, Simplifi\303\251/IRG, IFU).\n  * **Step 3 (*File Upload*):** Demands official business files (Extrait du RC, Carte NIF, Extrait de R\303\264le, and G\303\251rant ID). Dynamically appends specialized files (such as *R\303\251c\303\251piss\303\251 d\'agr\303\251ment* for Associations under Law 12-06, or *Certificat de label Startup DZ* for label holders).\n\n### 2. High-Contrast Magazine Landing Page (`Landing.tsx`)\n* **Editorial Split Hero Layout:** Offers a highly focused dual-content structure instead of a standard generic banner.\n* **Left Column (55%):** Features bold display typography with standard humble, bilingual subtext, prominent navigation call-to-actions (*\"Trouver un expert\"* and *\"Je suis professionnel\"*), and three small trust indicators.\n* **Right Column (45%):** Displays an organic, floating interactive consultant badge for **Me. Sofiane Benamara (Expert Comptable)**, demonstrating real-life ratings, seniorities, hourly rates (45,000 DA/mois), and a simulated responsive live contact trigger.\n* **High-Contrast Editorial Testimonials:** Showcases real Algerian business typologies:\n  * **SARL de BTP** (Tizi Ouzou) \342\200\224 Monthly G50 filings and CNAS reports check.\n  * **Startup labellis\303\251e** (Alger Tech Hub) \342\200\224 Compliance under the Finance Act 2026.\n  * **Association sportive** (Oran) \342\200\224 Subsidies audit under Law 12-06.\n  * **Auto-entrepreneur** (Constantine) \342\200\224 Simplified 5% IFU regime advice.\n  * **EPIC Municipale** (Blida) \342\200\224 Mandatory annual balance sheet certification.\n\n### 3. Specialty-Driven Board Card Variations (`ProfessionalCard.tsx`)\n* **Variant A (Expert Comptable / Commissaire aux Comptes):** Emphasizes national board member titles, prints accreditation numbers securely (`EC-16-0042`), and showcases premium tasks such as *Bilan Annuel*, *Commissariat*, and *Liasse SCF*.\n* **Variant B (Conseiller Fiscal / Expert Judiciaire):** Features dedicated justice/DGI badges and highlights tax disputes alongside court representation.\n* **Variant C (Comptable Agr\303\251\303\251):** Focuses on budget friendliness, highlighting daily management operations (*Tenue comptable*, *\330\252\330\265\330\261\331\212\330\255\330\247\330\252 G50*, and *CNAS/CASNOS*) for small-and-medium businesses (*Accessible PME*).\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 526977537
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
