ultiple components. In the Active Consultant Card, I\'ve identified several fields requiring localization: \"ONEC VERIFIED,\" \"Expert Comptable \342\200\224 ONEC,\" \"Secteur principal,\" \"EVALUATION,\" \"SENIORITE,\" and various others. I\'ve also found content within the Research Statistics Carousel, the Asymmetric Search Terminal box, the Featured section, and the Editorial Testimonials Section that need attention.\n\n\n"
