  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Identifying Key Terminology**\n\nOkay, I\'m now looking at some specific terminology pulled from an admin dashboard. I\'m focusing on identifying key phrases and labels: \"National Audit Authority\", \"DGI SUPERVISOR STATUS: INTERNAL AUDITOR\", \"Algeria Financial Compliance Gateway\", \"BOARD CONTROL ONLINE\", and \"Registered Cabinets\" have caught my attention as potentially relevant terms. I\'m trying to identify a common theme or categorization between the terms.\n\n\n**Expanding Translation Scope**\n\nOkay, I\'m now expanding the scope for translations. I\'ve identified several new key terms from admin and other sources: \"ONCC REGISTERED\", \"National SME Enrolment\", \"ACTIVE ENTITIES\", \"G50 Submission Compliance,\" and more. My focus is now on incorporating these into the translation process. I\'m reviewing `translations.ts` and preparing to update the content of `Landing.tsx`, `Tools.tsx`, and `AdminDashboard.tsx`, after taking a peek to ensure these are the only pages. I\'m focusing on ensuring all content is translatable.\n\n\n**Implementing Translation Strategy**\n\nI\'m now implementing the translation strategy. I\'m focusing on ensuring everything is translatable and reviewing the design as needed. I\'ve begun editing `/src/i18n/translations.ts` to add the missing translation strings and am structuring it nicely. I am currently focusing on translation keys for the Landing Page. I\'ve already prepared several keys: `heroSlogan`, `heroBadgeText`, `heroConsultantCard`, `availableImmediately`, and `contactTheExpert`.\n\n\n**Adding Translation Data**\n\nI\'ve added several new translation keys for the Landing Page, specifically focusing on card and label text. I\'ve now included translations for \"Contact the Expert\", \"Rating\", \"Seniority,\" \"12 yrs exp.\", \"45,000 DZD/month\", \"ONEC Verified\", \"Certified Documents\", \"Secured Contract,\" and \"All Wilayas (48)\". The translations are now implemented for Arabic, French, and English.\n\n\n**Incorporating Specific Translations**\n\nI\'m now incorporating specific translations for additional terms. I\'ve focused on adding translations for \"National Coverage,\" \"From North to the deep Algerian South,\" \"National Boards,\" \"Mandatory automated verification,\" \"Official Regulations,\" and \"Financial Accounting System (SCF) respected.\" I\'ve added these translations for Arabic, French, and English, ensuring the i18n file is up to date.\n\n\n**Adding New Translation Entries**\n\nI\'ve added new translation entries, focusing on key components of the search functionality. I\'ve included translations for \"Encrypted file backup\", \"Fully crypted verification filing dossiers,\" \"Search for Judicial / Fiscal / Accounting Partner,\" \"ex: G50, SCF balance sheet, fiscal return...\", and \"Search.\" I\'ve also incorporated translations for \"Featured National Order Profiles\" and their Arabic and French equivalents.\n\n\n**Adding More Translation Terms**\n\nI\'m now incorporating even more translation terms. I\'ve focused on adding translations for \"Confirmed active professional members. Each expert has a licensed practicing profile with a verified accreditation number and client reviews,\" \"Feedback from Local Algerian SME Entities,\" \"Testimonials and Regulatory Use Cases,\" and their Arabic and French equivalents. I\'m making progress in expanding the translation coverage to include detailed descriptions and feedback.\n\n\n**Adding Further Translation Details**\n\nI\'m now integrating new translations for key phrases. I\'ve focused on adding translations for \"From mandatory audits of sports associations in Oran, to startup tax certifications in Algiers. Discover why Algerian companies trust AccoNet,\" \"Verified AccoNet Contract\", \"Algerian Fiscal Simulations \342\200\224 Sandbox Showcase,\" and \"Calculate tax amounts TVA and TAP.\" I\'ve added these entries and completed Arabic, French, and English translations.\n\n\n**Adding Sandbox Simulations**\n\nI\'ve just added several new translation keys focused on simulation tools. I\'ve included translations for \"Simulate Tax Outflows: VAT, TAP, and SCF Ledgers,\" \"Assess compliance of your financial balance against the national Finance Act guidelines instantly through our tools,\" \"Open Sandbox Simulators \342\206\222,\" and translations for a widget for estimating tax returns. I\'ve finished adding Arabic and French equivalents.\n\n\n**Adding Tax Simulation Data**\n\nI\'m now incorporating specific translations for new terms related to the Jibayatic tax liability estimator and Sandbox features. I\'ve added translations for \"WIDGET: JIBAYATIC TAX LIABILITY ESTIMATOR,\" \"SANDBOX ACTIVE,\" \"TAP turnover tax base: Gross monthly revenue from exercise,\" \"Standard VAT rate: 19% (Regular bracket for imports/services),\" and \"Late payment penalty: 10% standard\". These are now complete in Arabic, French, and English, further expanding the tool\'s accessibility.\n\n\n**Adding Simulator Terminology**\n\nI\'m now integrating new translations for the Tools page. Specifically, I\'ve added entries for \"Interactive Sandbox Processing Engine,\" \"Active Simulator,\" \"Algerian Compliance Sandbox Engine,\" \"v2.5 (SCF),\" and \"Business Expenditure Narrative Description.\" I am also focusing on new key translations for \"Choose Voucher Scan\" and the associated Arabic and French equivalents. The translations are now implemented for Arabic, French, and English, further expanding the tool\'s accessibility.\n\n\n**Adding Tax Parameter Updates**\n\nI\'m now incorporating even more translation terms, specifically those related to tax parameters and trial balances. I\'ve added translations for \"Choose Local Voucher Scan Copy\", \"Input monthly financial parameters to auto-calculate raw G50 Tax liability\", \"Monthly Revenue (HT DZD)\", \"Staff Payroll Register (DZD)\", \"Current Trial Balance Sheet Ledger Values\", and \"SME Strategic Imperative.\" I am adding the associated Arabic and French equivalents, too. I\'m focusing on ensuring accuracy in technical terminology.\n\n\n**Adding Simulation Updates**\n\nI\'m now focusing on adding translations for simulation updates on the tool interface, particularly around instructions and ledger parameters. I\'ve included Arabic, French, and English equivalents for phrases such as \"Strategic Financial Directive for SMEs\", \"File Size: 4.88 MB \342\200\242 Secure Sealed Locker\", \"Processing raw ledger parameters...\", \"Provide transaction datasets above and click execution parameter to test ledger compliance.\", and \"Select the Audit Module from the right menu to display results.\" I\'m also preparing to add new module scan instructions.\n\n\n**Translating Report Output**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the translation of the simulation reports. I\'m prioritizing the output from the six tools to ensure complete language coverage. I\'m focusing on high-quality translations for each tool\'s results, with an example for Tool 0: I\'ve added Arabic translation for \"Auto Journal entry result\", and a detailed description that covers date, status, debit, credit and a brief description. I\'m working to make sure everything is translated!\n\n\n**Translating Detailed Report Output**\n\nI\'m now integrating translations for detailed financial report output, focusing on making the results of the sandbox simulations accessible in all languages. I\'ve added English, French, and Arabic translations, ensuring high-quality and accurate financial terminology. Specifically, I\'ve translated the structure for a generated SCF-compliant journal entry for tool 0, with example data. I\'m prioritizing accuracy to ensure clear comprehension.\n\n\n**Translating Diagnostic Report**\n\nI\'m now integrating translations for the automated OCR PDF diagnostic report. I\'ve added English, French, and Arabic equivalents for key data points extracted from a vendor invoice, focusing on accuracy. These include the document