  user_input {
    user_response: "Redesign AccoNet with a premium fintech visual identity.\n\nThe current design feels outdated, flat, and AI-generated.\n\nCompletely replace the visual direction.\n\n---\n\n## NEW VISUAL DIRECTION\n\nAccoNet should feel like:\n\n* a premium fintech SaaS\n* modern enterprise software\n* elegant Arabic-first product\n* calm and trustworthy\n\nReference aesthetic:\n\n* Linear\n* Stripe\n* Ramp\n* Notion\n* Raycast\n* Vercel\n\nBut adapted for Algerian accounting professionals.\n\n---\n\n## REMOVE THESE CURRENT DESIGN PROBLEMS\n\nRemove:\n\n* beige backgrounds\n* dull gray sections\n* flat white emptiness\n* cheap green tones\n* generic Tailwind spacing\n* oversized Arabic headings\n* centered-template layouts\n* weak typography contrast\n* random outlined boxes\n* thin low-contrast sections\n* dashboard-looking hero cards\n* generic CTA buttons\n\nThe current UI feels:\n\n* governmental\n* old\n* autogenerated\n* emotionally empty\n\nThe redesign must feel:\n\n* premium\n* sharp\n* intentional\n* confident\n* editorial\n* enterprise-grade\n\n---\n\n## NEW COLOR SYSTEM\n\nReplace the current palette entirely.\n\nPrimary background:\n#0B1020\n\nSecondary surfaces:\n#12182B\n#151C31\n\nPrimary accent:\n#14B8A6\n\nAccent hover:\n#0D9488\n\nText primary:\n#F8FAFC\n\nText secondary:\n#94A3B8\n\nBorders:\nrgba(255,255,255,0.08)\n\nSuccess:\n#22C55E\n\nWarning:\n#F59E0B\n\nUse VERY restrained color usage.\n\nDo not oversaturate the interface.\n\nThe UI should feel dark-premium with elegant teal accents.\n\n---\n\n## TYPOGRAPHY\n\nArabic typography must become premium.\n\nUse:\n\n* larger line height\n* tighter heading tracking\n* better vertical spacing\n* more elegant weight balance\n\nAvoid:\n\n* giant bold Arabic headlines\n* cramped sections\n* old-fashioned alignment\n\nTypography should feel modern and luxurious.\n\n---\n\n## HERO SECTION REDESIGN\n\nThe current hero section is weak.\n\nRedesign it completely.\n\nNew structure:\n\n* split asymmetric layout\n* left side: premium UI preview/dashboard\n* right side: strong Arabic editorial typography\n* subtle gradient lighting\n* floating glass panels ONLY if subtle\n* layered depth\n\nAdd:\n\n* trusted by Algerian businesses\n* verified accountant indicators\n* elegant metrics\n* refined spacing\n\nThe hero must feel:\n\n* high-end\n* product-focused\n* investor-ready\n\n---\n\n## CARD DESIGN\n\nCurrent cards look cheap.\n\nNew cards:\n\n* layered surfaces\n* subtle border glow\n* soft depth\n* smaller radius\n* cleaner spacing\n* stronger hierarchy\n\nDo NOT use:\n\n* thick borders\n* giant shadows\n* repetitive layouts\n\nCards should resemble:\n\n* Stripe dashboard cards\n* Linear panels\n* premium SaaS widgets\n\n---\n\n## BUTTONS\n\nButtons currently look generic.\n\nRedesign:\n\n* tighter height\n* better padding rhythm\n* subtle hover illumination\n* premium focus states\n* less rounded corners\n\nPrimary CTA:\ndark teal glow accent\n\nSecondary CTA:\ntransparent surface with border\n\n---\n\n## NAVBAR\n\nThe navbar must become:\n\n* thinner\n* more premium\n* more minimal\n* better aligned\n\nAdd:\n\n* subtle backdrop blur\n* transparent dark surface\n* refined spacing\n* elegant language switcher\n\nRemove:\n\n* bulky spacing\n* cheap outlined controls\n\n---\n\n## ARABIC RTL EXPERIENCE\n\nArabic mode must feel native and luxurious.\n\nNOT mirrored mechanically.\n\nRequirements:\n\n* right-aligned editorial layout\n* elegant RTL spacing\n* premium Arabic composition\n* refined typography rhythm\n* better content density\n\nArabic should feel FIRST-CLASS.\n\n---\n\n## MICRO INTERACTIONS\n\nAdd:\n\n* soft hover elevation\n* subtle opacity transitions\n* smooth state animations\n* premium motion timing\n\nAvoid:\n\n* flashy movement\n* bounce animations\n* exaggerated effects\n\n---\n\n## FINAL GOAL\n\nThe final website should look like:\n\n* a funded Algerian fintech startup\n* designed by elite product designers\n* commercially believable\n* handcrafted\n* modern without looking trendy\n\nNobody should think:\n\"This was AI-generated.\"\n\nThey should think:\n\"This looks like a real startup product worth millions.\""
    items {
      text: "Redesign AccoNet with a premium fintech visual identity.\n\nThe current design feels outdated, flat, and AI-generated.\n\nCompletely replace the visual direction.\n\n---\n\n## NEW VISUAL DIRECTION\n\nAccoNet should feel like:\n\n* a premium fintech SaaS\n* modern enterprise software\n* elegant Arabic-first product\n* calm and trustworthy\n\nReference aesthetic:\n\n* Linear\n* Stripe\n* Ramp\n* Notion\n* Raycast\n* Vercel\n\nBut adapted for Algerian accounting professionals.\n\n---\n\n## REMOVE THESE CURRENT DESIGN PROBLEMS\n\nRemove:\n\n* beige backgrounds\n* dull gray sections\n* flat white emptiness\n* cheap green tones\n* generic Tailwind spacing\n* oversized Arabic headings\n* centered-template layouts\n* weak typography contrast\n* random outlined boxes\n* thin low-contrast sections\n* dashboard-looking hero cards\n* generic CTA buttons\n\nThe current UI feels:\n\n* governmental\n* old\n* autogenerated\n* emotionally empty\n\nThe redesign must feel:\n\n* premium\n* sharp\n* intentional\n* confident\n* editorial\n* enterprise-grade\n\n---\n\n## NEW COLOR SYSTEM\n\nReplace the current palette entirely.\n\nPrimary background:\n#0B1020\n\nSecondary surfaces:\n#12182B\n#151C31\n\nPrimary accent:\n#14B8A6\n\nAccent hover:\n#0D9488\n\nText primary:\n#F8FAFC\n\nText secondary:\n#94A3B8\n\nBorders:\nrgba(255,255,255,0.08)\n\nSuccess:\n#22C55E\n\nWarning:\n#F59E0B\n\nUse VERY restrained color usage.\n\nDo not oversaturate the interface.\n\nThe UI should feel dark-premium with elegant teal accents.\n\n---\n\n## TYPOGRAPHY\n\nArabic typography must become premium.\n\nUse:\n\n* larger line height\n* tighter heading tracking\n* better vertical spacing\n* more elegant weight balance\n\nAvoid:\n\n* giant bold Arabic headlines\n* cramped sections\n* old-fashioned alignment\n\nTypography should feel modern and luxurious.\n\n---\n\n## HERO SECTION REDESIGN\n\nThe current hero section is weak.\n\nRedesign it completely.\n\nNew structure:\n\n* split asymmetric layout\n* left side: premium UI preview/dashboard\n* right side: strong Arabic editorial typography\n* subtle gradient lighting\n* floating glass panels ONLY if subtle\n* layered depth\n\nAdd:\n\n* trusted by Algerian businesses\n* verified accountant indicators\n* elegant metrics\n* refined spacing\n\nThe hero must feel:\n\n* high-end\n* product-focused\n* investor-ready\n\n---\n\n## CARD DESIGN\n\nCurrent cards look cheap.\n\nNew cards:\n\n* layered surfaces\n* subtle border glow\n* soft depth\n* smaller radius\n* cleaner spacing\n* stronger hierarchy\n\nDo NOT use:\n\n* thick borders\n* giant shadows\n* repetitive layouts\n\nCards should resemble:\n\n* Stripe dashboard cards\n* Linear panels\n* premium SaaS widgets\n\n---\n\n## BUTTONS\n\nButtons currently look generic.\n\nRedesign:\n\n* tighter height\n* better padding rhythm\n* subtle hover illumination\n* premium focus states\n* less rounded corners\n\nPrimary CTA:\ndark teal glow accent\n\nSecondary CTA:\ntransparent surface with border\n\n---\n\n## NAVBAR\n\nThe navbar must become:\n\n* thinner\n* more premium\n* more minimal\n* better aligned\n\nAdd:\n\n* subtle backdrop blur\n* transparent dark surface\n* refined spacing\n* elegant language switcher\n\nRemove:\n\n* bulky spacing\n* cheap outlined controls\n\n---\n\n## ARABIC RTL EXPERIENCE\n\nArabic mode must feel native and luxurious.\n\nNOT mirrored mechanically.\n\nRequirements:\n\n* right-aligned editorial layout\n* elegant RTL spacing\n* premium Arabic composition\n* refined typography rhythm\n* better content density\n\nArabic should feel FIRST-CLASS.\n\n---\n\n## MICRO INTERACTIONS\n\nAdd:\n\n* soft hover elevation\n* subtle opacity transitions\n* smooth state animations\n* premium motion timing\n\nAvoid:\n\n* flashy movement\n* bounce animations\n* exaggerated effects\n\n---\n\n## FINAL GOAL\n\nThe final website should look like:\n\n* a funded Algerian fintech startup\n* designed by elite product designers\n* commercially believable\n* handcrafted\n* modern without looking trendy\n\nNobody should think:\n\"This was AI-generated.\"\n\nThey should think:\n\"This looks like a real startup product worth millions.\""
