  planner_response {
    modified_response: "### Redesign Overview\n\nI have completed a total visual reconstruction of **AccoNet**, transforming it from an outdated, flat template into a modern, world-class fintech SaaS that feels beautiful, deliberate, and intentional.\n\n---\n\n### Key Visual & Functional Accomplishments\n\n1. **Foundational Color System (`index.css`)**\n   - **Cosmic Deep Palette**: Shifted the workspace from raw grays and dusty beige to a luxury dark theme featuring deep obsidian slate (`#0B1020`) and dark navy panels (`#12182B`, `#151C31`).\n   - **Teal Neon Accents & Radiance**: Mapped `#14B8A6` as a surgical neon highlight that glows subtly behind essential elements using balanced custom box shadows and delicate radial blur decorators.\n\n2. **Luxury Minimalist Navigation (`Navbar.tsx`)**\n   - Transformed the header into a razor-thin, glass-morphic banner with a real backdrop-blur (`backdrop-blur-md`) and translucent borders (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`).\n   - Re-styled controls like buttons, responsive drop-downs, and custom localizations to support fluid RTL and LTR movements naturally.\n\n3. **Asymmetric Fintech Hero & Interactive Landing (`Landing.tsx`)**\n   - **Split Layout Hero**: Replaced the dry layout with a dynamic left-column typographic block paired with a sharp right-column interactive expert card highlighting certified practitioner credentials, immediate availabilities, and regional Wilaya coverage.\n   - **Aesthetic Pairings**: Created clear, crisp visual indicators utilizing modern grotesque display sans headings combined with monospace micro-tags for local audit codes (SCF 2026, G50, Article 222 CP).\n\n4. **Stripe-grade Filter Panel & Card Grid (`Search.tsx`, `SearchFilters.tsx`, `ProfessionalCard.tsx`)**\n   - **Dashboard-level Sidebar**: Re-styled all query sliders, custom checkboxes, and dropdown inputs into high-contrast dark-mode widgets with sleek emerald-accent states.\n   - **Premium Practice Cards**: Redesigned individual practitioner widgets as Linear-style panels. Added discrete region stamps, active regional board indicators, and responsive hover transitions without visual noise.\n\n5. **Sandbox Terminal Audits (`Tools.tsx`)**\n   - Converted the calculators and compliance simulation windows into cohesive slate terminals. Input states adapt effortlessly across dark-theme form components, printing clear monospace report summaries.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Results\n\n* **Linter Validation**: Checked compiling parameters natively\342\200\224the entire codebase linted beautifully with zero errors.\n* **Build System Compilation**: Successfully compiled into static production bundles with total type safety."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
